#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:1
msgid "Single-Objective Optimization"
msgstr "単目的最適化"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:3
msgid ""
"Solve a single-objective optimization problem with an expensive-to-"
"evaluate objective function, using `saealib`."
msgstr "評価コストの高い目的関数を持つ単目的最適化問題を、`saealib`で解きます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:5
msgid ""
"First we define the problem and solve it with the high-level API "
"`minimize`, then move on to the low-level API with `Optimizer`."
msgstr "まず問題を定義し、高レベルAPIの`minimize`で解いたあと、`Optimizer`による低レベルAPIへ進みます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:7
msgid ""
"For the detailed specification and customization of each component, see "
"the [Components](../components/index.md) pages linked from the following "
"sections."
msgstr "各コンポーネントの詳しい仕様やカスタマイズ方法は、この後の節からリンクする[コンポーネント](../components/index.md)配下の各ページを参照してください。"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:9
msgid "Problem setup"
msgstr "問題設定"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:11
msgid ""
"Assume an objective function whose single call takes a long time, like a "
"simulation."
msgstr "シミュレーションのように、1回の呼び出しに時間がかかる目的関数を想定します。"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:13
msgid ""
"Here, as an example, we minimize the Sphere function as a stand-in for an"
" expensive-to-evaluate function."
msgstr "ここでは例として、評価コストの高さを模したSphere関数を最小化します。"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:29
msgid ""
"`DIM` is the number of design-variable dimensions, and `LB`/`UB` are "
"`DIM`-dimensional lists giving its lower and upper bounds."
msgstr "`DIM`は設計変数の次元数、`LB`と`UB`はその下限と上限を与える`DIM`次元のリストです。"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:31
msgid ""
"The objective function is defined as a `Callable` that takes a "
"`DIM`-dimensional design variable and returns the objective value."
msgstr "目的関数は、`DIM`次元の設計変数を受け取り、目的関数値を返す`Callable`として定義します。"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:33
msgid "High-level API: minimize / maximize"
msgstr "高レベルAPI：minimize / maximize"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:35
msgid ""
"`minimize` is a high-level API that runs an optimization just by "
"specifying `dim`, `lb`, and `ub`."
msgstr "`minimize`は、`dim`、`lb`、`ub`を指定するだけで最適化を実行できる高レベルAPIです。"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:48
msgid ""
"If the maximum number of evaluations `max_fe` is omitted, `200 * dim` is "
"used as the default."
msgstr "最大評価回数`max_fe`を省略すると、`200 * dim`が既定値として使われます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:50
msgid "To explicitly limit the number of evaluations, specify it as follows."
msgstr "評価回数を明示的に制限するには、次のように指定します。"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:56
msgid "Switching components"
msgstr "コンポーネントの切り替え"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:58
msgid ""
"`minimize` lets you switch three components — the evolutionary algorithm,"
" the surrogate model, and the evaluation strategy — via the string-valued"
" `algorithm`, `surrogate`, and `strategy` arguments, respectively."
msgstr "`minimize`は、進化的アルゴリズム、サロゲートモデル、評価戦略という3つのコンポーネントを、それぞれ`algorithm`、`surrogate`、`strategy`引数の文字列で切り替えられます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:60
msgid "For all three, you can also pass an instance directly instead of a string."
msgstr "3つとも、文字列の代わりにインスタンスを直接渡すこともできます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:62
msgid ""
"The internal behavior and customization of each component are covered on "
"the [Algorithm](../components/algorithm.md), "
"[Surrogate](../components/surrogate.md), and "
"[OptimizationStrategy](../components/strategies.md) pages."
msgstr "各コンポーネントの内部動作やカスタマイズ方法は、[Algorithm](../components/algorithm.md)、[Surrogate](../components/surrogate.md)、[OptimizationStrategy](../components/strategies.md)のページで扱います。"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:64
msgid "Algorithm"
msgstr "アルゴリズム"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:66
msgid ""
"The `algorithm` argument selects the evolutionary algorithm that "
"generates candidate solutions."
msgstr "`algorithm`引数は、候補解を生成する進化的アルゴリズムを選びます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md
msgid "String"
msgstr "文字列"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md
msgid "Class"
msgstr "クラス"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md
msgid "Characteristics"
msgstr "特徴"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md
msgid "`'GA'`"
msgstr "`'GA'`"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md
msgid "`GA`"
msgstr "`GA`"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md
msgid "Search via crossover and mutation (default)"
msgstr "交叉と突然変異による探索（既定）"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md
msgid "`'PSO'`"
msgstr "`'PSO'`"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md
msgid "`PSO`"
msgstr "`PSO`"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md
msgid "Search via particle velocity updates"
msgstr "粒子の速度更新による探索"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:77
msgid "Surrogate"
msgstr "サロゲート"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:79
msgid ""
"The `surrogate` argument selects the surrogate model that approximates "
"the objective function."
msgstr "`surrogate`引数は、目的関数を近似するサロゲートモデルを選びます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md
msgid "Resolved configuration"
msgstr "解決される構成"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md
msgid "Description"
msgstr "説明"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md
msgid "`'rbf'`"
msgstr "`'rbf'`"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md
msgid "`RBFSurrogate` + `LocalSurrogateManager` (default)"
msgstr "`RBFSurrogate` + `LocalSurrogateManager`（既定）"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md
msgid "Local fit over nearby points using a Gaussian RBF kernel"
msgstr "ガウスRBFカーネルによる近傍点の局所フィット"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:89
msgid "Evaluation strategy"
msgstr "評価戦略"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:91
msgid ""
"The `strategy` argument selects the evaluation strategy that decides "
"which of the generated candidates receive a true (expensive) evaluation."
msgstr "`strategy`引数は、生成した候補解のうちどれに真の（高コストな）評価を行うかを決める評価戦略を選びます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "動作"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md
msgid "`'ib'`"
msgstr "`'ib'`"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md
msgid "`IndividualBasedStrategy`"
msgstr "`IndividualBasedStrategy`"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md
msgid ""
"Evaluates each candidate individually with the surrogate and truly "
"evaluates only the top `evaluation_ratio` fraction (default)"
msgstr "候補を個別にサロゲートで評価し、上位`evaluation_ratio`の割合だけを真に評価する（既定）"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md
msgid "`'gb'`"
msgstr "`'gb'`"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md
msgid "`GenerationBasedStrategy`"
msgstr "`GenerationBasedStrategy`"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md
msgid ""
"Advances `gen_ctrl` generations using only the surrogate, then truly "
"evaluates a single generation"
msgstr "`gen_ctrl`世代分をサロゲートのみで進め、1世代だけ真に評価する"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md
msgid "`'ps'`"
msgstr "`'ps'`"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md
msgid "`PreSelectionStrategy`"
msgstr "`PreSelectionStrategy`"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md
msgid ""
"Narrows down a large pool of candidates with the surrogate and truly "
"evaluates only the top `n_select`"
msgstr "大量の候補をサロゲートで絞り込み、上位`n_select`個だけを真に評価する"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:103
msgid "Low-level API: Optimizer"
msgstr "低レベルAPI：Optimizer"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:105
msgid ""
"`minimize` wires up each component with a default combination, but "
"doesn't let you tune individual parameters."
msgstr "`minimize`は各コンポーネントを既定の組み合わせで結び付けますが、個々のパラメータまでは調整できません。"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:107
msgid ""
"Instantiating components individually and assembling them into "
"`Optimizer` removes this limitation."
msgstr "コンポーネントを個別にインスタンス化し、`Optimizer`に組み込めば、この制約を外せます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:181
msgid ""
"Pass the same value to both `Optimizer(problem, seed=SEED)` and "
"`LHSInitializer(..., seed=SEED)` for the random seed."
msgstr "乱数シードは、`Optimizer(problem, seed=SEED)`と`LHSInitializer(..., seed=SEED)`の両方に同じ値を渡してください。"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:183
msgid ""
"`Optimizer`'s `seed` is only auto-propagated to the default "
"`LHSInitializer` when you skip calling `set_initializer()` yourself (e.g."
" via `minimize`/`maximize`)."
msgstr "`Optimizer`の`seed`は、`set_initializer()`を呼ばずに済ませたとき（`minimize`/`maximize`など）だけ、既定の`LHSInitializer`へ自動的に伝播します。"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:185
msgid ""
"If you assemble the `Initializer` yourself, you need to pass it "
"explicitly."
msgstr "`Initializer`を自分で組み立てる場合は、明示的に渡す必要があります。"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:187
msgid "`Termination` accepts multiple conditions."
msgstr "`Termination`には複数の条件を渡せます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:189
msgid ""
"The run ends as soon as any one of the listed conditions is met (logical "
"OR)."
msgstr "列挙した条件は、いずれか1つが満たされた時点で終了します（OR結合）。"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:197
msgid "You can also add a custom condition with a lambda."
msgstr "カスタム条件をlambdaで追加することもできます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:206
msgid ""
"Using `iterate()` instead of `run()` lets you obtain the context "
"generation by generation."
msgstr "`run()`の代わりに`iterate()`を使うと、世代単位でコンテキストを取得できます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:208
msgid ""
"This is useful for recording progress or implementing custom early "
"stopping."
msgstr "進捗の記録や、カスタムな早期終了の実装に使えます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/single_objective.md:229
msgid "References"
msgstr "参照"

